<title>USA: Mobil to accept payments on the internet.</title>
<headline>Mobil to accept payments on the internet.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobil Corp and National Processing Inc Monday introduced an Internet payment service for Mobil's credit cardholders, National Processing said.</p>
<p>Using National Processing's Virtual PAY process, Mobil will now accept monthly payments from its cardholders over the Internet as well as through the mail.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
